{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 5724 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 22 days of lisinopril on hand and Corvale General has 23 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label lists Aurobindo Pharma Limited as a registered manufacturing plant with FEI 3004021229.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 684552 of that plant ended on 2010-09-24 and was classified OAI, with the classification known on 2010-12-23.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 5724 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections of the same plant from 2011 through 2023 were all classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label also names APL HEALTHCARE LIMITED (FEI 3011895410) as a registered plant, whose most recent inspection in 2025-12-17 was VAI.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
